  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Armies of the Lord**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Need More Bandages**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Charlie Sheen Reaches Out to the Feds**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Dawn of Revelation**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Bride**: back after 184 archived shows (2597 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Collapsing Stars**: back after 130 archived shows (1707 days); rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **From TG&Y**: back after 65 archived shows (944 days) [2]\n- **Genesis 3 23**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2026-05-29** (recommended): soundboard; 24 songs; 110 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children, abridged Overture, solo transition and [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2026-05-29**: taped by Kyle Kennelly & Emerald Green; transferred by Kyle Kennelly; source: SBD [Engineer: Erich Miller] > PCM-A10 + Tascam FR-AV2 > DPA4060s (Healy On Stage) [1]. Also: Erich Miller was the sound engineer for this show, and the taping was permitted by the band and their management [1]",
